[ti:I Am the Music Man]
[al:lesson l5]
[offset:0]
[00:11.80]I am the Music Man,
[00:14.36]I come from far away,
[00:15.68]And I can play!
[00:17.68]What can you play?
[00:20.28]I play the piano!
[00:22.10]Pia, pia, piano, piano, piano,
[00:26.18]Pia, pia, piano, pia, piano!
[00:33.76]I am the Music Man,
[00:36.14]I come from far away,
[00:37.64]And I can play!
[00:39.10]What can you play?
[00:42.16]I play the trombone!
[00:43.98]Trom, trom, trombone, trombone, trombone,
[00:46.54]Trom, trom, trombone, trom, trombone!
[01:03.94]I am the Music Man,
[01:05.90]I come from far away,
[01:07.66]And I can play!
[01:09.10]What can you play?
[01:11.14]I play the violin!
[01:14.76]Vio, vio, violin, violin, violin,
[01:19.30]Vio, vio, violin, vio, violin!
